{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01KCQ39ZqfHSANwwCmXWf2zc", "type": "tool_result", "content": "total 8\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 user  wheel  128 Oct 19 16:35 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 user  wheel  128 Oct 19 16:35 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 user  wheel   96 Oct 19 16:35 .claude\n-rw-r--r--  1 user  wheel  391 Oct 19 16:35 premise.md\n# 002 · 选题\n\n给一个新的爽文故事定选题。这个故事以后可以写成网文，也可以拍成竖屏短剧。\n\n这一步只定选题，不写大纲和正文。\n\n交付（写成文件，放在当前目录）：\n\n1. 一句话卖点\n2. 选题说明：题材，写给谁看，主角和对手，核心冲突，开篇钩子，爽点从哪来，打算写多长、为什么撑得住", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "3d6ad1dd-9aa5-45be-b6f6-1447b27b75d0", "uuid": "d90f448a-8505-459d-a6af-89bcc18be60a", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T23:35:30.972Z", "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01KCQ39ZqfHSANwwCmXWf2zc", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
